MaxNumberOfDistributedComputingParameters "2"
UseDistributedComputingMemorySetting "False"
MinDistributedComputingMemoryLimit "0"
UseDistributedComputingSharedDirectory "False"
OnlyConsider0D1DResultsForDC "False"

